#. toolbar check box: the figure's one 3D switch
msgid "Enable 3D"
msgstr "3D einschalten"

#. toolbar button: opens KScreen, where the screen's 3D mode and the depth limits are set
msgid "3D display settings..."
msgstr "3D-Anzeigeeinstellungen ..."

#. %s is the system's reason, already translated by the C library
#, c-format
msgid "The display settings could not be opened: %s"
msgstr "Die Anzeigeeinstellungen konnten nicht geöffnet werden: %s"

#. the figure's window is not an X11 window (Qt on Wayland, the web or another backend)
msgid "This figure is shown flat: its window cannot hold a 3D area. The Tk and Qt windows on X11 can."
msgstr "Diese Abbildung wird flach angezeigt: Ihr Fenster kann keinen 3D-Bereich enthalten. Tk- und Qt-Fenster unter X11 können das."

#. the desktop is a stereo desktop too old for a 3D area inside a window, or the person ticked Enable 3D on a 2D desktop
msgid "This figure is shown flat: this desktop does not show 3D areas inside windows."
msgstr "Diese Abbildung wird flach angezeigt: Dieser Desktop zeigt keine 3D-Bereiche in Fenstern an."

#. the desktop draws the pair but sends no depth limits, so the two cameras coincide
msgid "This desktop does not offer depth limits, so both eyes show the same picture."
msgstr "Dieser Desktop bietet keine Tiefengrenzen, deshalb sehen beide Augen dasselbe Bild."
